    a3.set_title("(c) Episode length", loc="left", fontsize=6.2)

    # (d) P(next derivation of the same fact correct | previous one wrong, truth unchanged in between), revision r2
    # (revision_r2/repeat_error.json): consecutive derivations only, (i) main ESM run (s0 + its re-derivations, ALL) and
    # (ii) every real arm, each (fact, commit) derivation counted once.  Pooled over pairs (repository-cluster CI) and
